y code remotely. Attackers can read arbitrary files, including SSH keys and passwords. It is recommended to update to the latest Jenkins versions or temporarily disable Jenkins CLI access.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-26T11:52:20.000Z"},{"id":"5DU5TCj3t","title":"Elusive Chinese Cyberspy Group Hijacks Software Updates to Deliver Malware","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/elusive-chinese-cyberspy-group-hijacks-software-updates-to-deliver-malware/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/elusive-chinese-cyberspy-group-hijacks-software-updates-to-deliver-malware-5du5tcj3t","summary":"A Chinese cyberespionage group called Blackwood has been hijacking software updates to deliver a sophisticated implant called NSPX30. The group has remained undetected for approximately five years and has targeted organizations and individuals in China and Japan.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-26T11:30:21.000Z"},{"id":"AePivXZfu","title":"Russian TrickBot Malware Developer Sentenced to Prison in US","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/russian-trickbot-malware-developer-sentenced-to-prison-in-us/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/russian-trickbot-malware-developer-sentenced-to-prison-in-us-aepivxzfu","summary":"A Russian national has been sentenced to prison in the US for his role in the development and distribution of the TrickBot malware, which caused significant financial losses to organizations worldwide.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-26T11:19:44.000Z"},{"id":"ruhMYnukm","title":"Nozomi Unveils Wireless Security Sensor for OT, IoT Environments","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/nozomi-unveils-wireless-security-sensor-for-ot-iot-environments/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/nozomi-unveils-wireless-security-sensor-for-ot-iot-environments-ruhmynukm","summary":"Nozomi Networks has unveiled Guardian Air, a wireless security sensor for OT and IoT environments. It continuously monitors frequencies associated with various protocols to detect potential threats. The collected data is analyzed alongside network and endpoint security data in Nozomi's cloud-based management system. Guardian Air provides accurate visibility and helps minimize risk while maximizing resiliency.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-26T08:59:56.000Z"},{"id":"Y5RtA8F8R","title":"In the Context of Cloud, Security and Mobility, It\u2019s Time Organizations Ditch Legacy MPLS","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/in-the-context-of-cloud-security-and-mobility-its-time-organizations-ditch-legacy-mpls/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/in-the-context-of-cloud-security-and-mobility-it-s-time-organizations-ditch-legacy-mpls-y5rta8f8r","summary":"Organizations face challenges with MPLS due to its outdated design, high costs, and limited service level agreements. The internet is an alternative but has limitations in terms of reliability and security. SD-WAN and SASE can provide a better solution by offering fast packet delivery, reduced costs, and improved security.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-25T16:10:09.000Z"},{"id":"HIPAIqX6z","title":"New Offerings From Protect AI, Venafi Tackle Software Supply Chain Security","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/new-offerings-from-protect-ai-venafi-tackle-software-supply-chain-security/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/new-offerings-from-protect-ai-venafi-tackle-software-supply-chain-security-hipaiqx6z","summary":"New products from Venafi and Protect AI address security concerns in the open source software (OSS) and machine learning models supply chain.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/6d087193f1172e83d5c303c21c587369?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-25T14:42:06.000Z"},{"id":"vtqdKKqzT","title":"Cisco Patches Critical Vulnerability in Enterprise Collaboration Products","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/cisco-patches-critical-vulnerability-in-enterprise-collaboration-products/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cisco-patches-critical-vulnerability-in-enterprise-collaboration-products-vtqdkkqzt","summary":"Cisco has announced patches for a critical vulnerability in Unified Communications and Contact Center Solutions products. The vulnerability could allow an attacker to execute arbitrary commands on the underlying operating system with root access. Cisco recommends updating to a patched version and implementing access control lists (ACLs) to mitigate the bug.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-25T13:09:44.000Z"},{"id":"EG7BL9CKs","title":"Volexity Catches Chinese Hackers Exploiting Ivanti VPN Zero-Days","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/volexity-catches-chinese-hackers-exploiting-ivanti-vpn-zero-days/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/volexity-catches-chinese-hackers-exploiting-ivanti-vpn-zero-days-eg7bl9cks","summary":"Chinese hackers are actively exploiting unauthenticated remote zero-day vulnerabilities in Ivanti Connect Secure VPN devices. Ivanti has released pre-patch mitigations while comprehensive fixes are under development. Volexity discovered the exploits after noticing suspicious activity on one of its customer's networks.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c31260f8e5121331bccf3a9913ce5757?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-10T21:22:20.000Z"},{"id":"iTSszMwwR","title":"ExtraHop Banks $100M in Growth Funding, Adds New Execs","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/extrahop-banks-100m-in-growth-funding-adds-new-execs/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/extrahop-banks-100m-in-growth-funding-adds-new-execs-itsszmwwr","summary":"ExtraHop, a company in the IT analytics and network detection and response business, secures $100 million in growth funding and hires new executives to drive future growth.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-10T19:54:08.000Z"},{"id":"92qVZ40Iw","title":"HMG Healthcare Says Data Breach Impacts 40 Facilities","url":"https://www.securityweek.com/hmg-healthcare-says-data-breach-impacts-40-facilities/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/hmg-healthcare-says-data-breach-impacts-40-facilities-92qvz40iw","summary":"HMG Healthcare has disclosed a data breach impacting the personal health information of employees and residents at 40 affiliated nursing facilities. The breach involved hackers gaining access to the server and stealing unencrypted files containing medical records and personal information. Potentially impacted individuals are advised to monitor their account statements and credit reports.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/2dc12b0982a588ddbaacc908762a738e?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-01-10T17:13:00.000Z"}],"similar_handles":["gamesindustry","trendmicro","arstechnica","itsecurityguru","dr"],"opposite_handles":["dailydevworld","horde","on_leuwcq","watercooler","dotnetsquad"],"similar":[{"id":"gamesindustry","handle":"gamesindustry","name":"GamesIndustry.b